                    "frequency": "VeryLow",
                    "semantic_group_id": "curse",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "In ancient texts, the city was considered an <w>anathema</w> to be destroyed."
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "The heretic was labeled an <w>anathema</w> and shunned by all the faithful."
